      <activity id="f294aea3-d26a-5c97-93cc-c1c6625ebf48" activityNameId="bcf22cbc-332e-5d79-b38a-8fdca0a60c20" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, PV in PVT-System, 16.7kWp,  single-Si,  slanted-roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, PV in PVT-System, 16.7kWp,  single-Si,  slanted-roof
This inventory is valid for the electricity production of a PVT system only. The electricity efficiency in a PVT system is about 5% better as a comparable PV panel. Dataset can be used for comparison of energy technologies in Switzerland, but not for assessment of average production patterns. Yield data must be corrected for the installations used in other countries.;
UUID: e10948cd-8c10-36ac-a10b-e7009660c5c2
Infrastructure for 16.7kWp PV-plant in a PVT system. Water use for cleaning. Amount of solar energy transformed to electricity. Waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system. The thermal components are not included but allocated to the heat production of the PVT system.
Location: Use in CH.
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer and literature data on worldwide module production. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e10948cd-8c10-36ac-a10b-e7009660c5c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
